    "detailed_description": "Dive deeper into the bug-bashing frenzy with Bug Bash! This fast-paced, interactive game now offers 20 unique levels, each presenting its own set of challenges and a variety of bugs to bash. Protect different food items as you progress, adding a strategic twist to your exterminating adventures. On top of the regular critters, keep an eye out for rare bugs \u2013 bashing them earns you bonus points! Whether you're a veteran gamer or just looking for some engaging entertainment, Bug Bash\u2019s blend of action and strategy will keep you engaged. Join the fun and discover how adept you are at protecting your feast while bashing those pesky bugs!<br><br>Bash bugs to accumulate points and advance to the next level. Beware, as missed hits and bugs that escape will deduct points from your score.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586680/extras/89c1c663c86847c98bbcd474528a3c3a.avif?t=1742657255\" width=600 height=114 /></span><br><br>Guard the food against bugs within the set time limit to earn bonus points. Successfully protecting the food boosts your score.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586680/extras/fee4b821b4a246f2dec8d5d7c59772f9.avif?t=1742657255\" width=600 height=108 /></span><br><br>Birds are your allies, helping to eat bugs, while bees quell the bugs' hunger. However, be cautious: accidentally bashing birds or bees will result in a significant point penalty.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586680/extras/737cc0916699def8bc8cfa18707c9946.avif?t=1742657255\" width=600 height=140 /></span>",
